\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs36\lang9 Dragon Quest XI S Party Chat - Veronica\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1512\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cf1\b0\f1\fs22 Veronica\cell Serena and I just happened to come across Hotto on our travels. I thought a trip to the bathhouse would be a nice way to relax...\par
\par
But as soon as I went through the door, a bunch of monsters attacked me. Honestly, what is the world coming to!?\par
\par
Anyway, they kidnapped me and took me back to their lair. It's this giant underground labyrinth out to the west. We have to go there and find Serena. Once you're all set, let's get going!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1512\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Serena and I were always the same height growing up... Imagine how strange it is for me to be smaller than her!?\par
\par
Still, if those stupid monsters hadn't shrunk me, I'd never have been able to escape, so I guess every cloud has its silver lining.\par
\par
Now let's get going, <pc>! I'll bet the creeps who stole my magic powers are going to be skulking somewhere inside the labyrinth.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Well, I've got my magic powers back, but our work here's not done just yet!\par
\par
The monsters have someone else locked up right behind the place where we fought Jarvis. We have to help!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh907\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I don't mean to be rude, <pc>, but has anyone ever mentioned that you seem to have trouble staying focused?\par
\par
You're just like my sister. You're supposed to be doing one thing, but you somehow manage to forget what it was. I have a feeling you and her are going to get on just fine...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell This has all been a bit of a pain, but at least I got my magic powers back. And I'm getting used to my new look.\par
\par
Oh, and we stopped those monsters that were menacing Hotto\emdash not that anyone there even noticed what was going on, of course. They were too busy stewing their brains in the bathhouse.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1210\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I still can't work out how you thought a girl whose dad was missing was looking for her sister. I mean, how stupid can you be!?\par
\par
Anyway, if I'm going to get any useful information out of this bar owner, it looks like I'm going to have to talk to him myself. Come on, let's get going!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh907\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Um, is there a reason we're not heading to the labyrinth?\par
\par
We need to head west, get my magic powers back and teach those monsters a lesson. They're pretty tough, though, so make sure you're ready for them!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh907\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I still can't work it out. If the Dark One was really defeated, why have you been reborn now?\par
\par
Well, all I know is that we have a sacred duty to fulfil. With any luck, once we get you safely to Yggdrasil, all will be revealed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1452\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell When I first met Erik, I thought he was a real no-hoper, but it turns out he is capable of having ideas that aren't completely stupid.\par
\par
Well, we know what we're looking for\emdash someone who managed to break off a branch of the World Tree. Who would do a thing like that, though?\par
\par
Still, let's see what they've got to say. If we're lucky, they'll be able to tell us how they managed to reach Yggdrasil.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Keep your wits about you, <pc>. This place is full of tricks and traps. We'll end up stuck in here forever if we're not careful.\par
\par
To be honest, it was a miracle I managed to escape. The main thing I learnt was to always watch my step...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Um, is there a reason we're hanging round here? It doesn't exactly bring back happy memories for me, you know.\par
\par
...Wait, let me guess! You're looking for treasure chests you might have missed, aren't you? Well, fine. But if you think we're staying here all day, you're very much mistaken!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Don't tell me you're lost! You have heard of these things called maps, haven't you?\par
\par
When I first started travelling with Serena, we'd get lost a lot. But then we learnt to read maps properly and never looked back. Give it a go, why don't you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I'm starting to think you weren't listening to me, <pc>... You know we have something we need to do, don't you?\par
\par
Is wandering around the place going to help me get my magic powers back? Well? Is it?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell So according to Noah, there's a branch from Yggdrasil somewhere in the palace here in Gallopolis.\par
\par
I mean, even if he's telling the truth and there really is a branch, I'm still not sure it's going to help us get to Yggdrasil. But we don't have any better ideas...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Let's have a little look round town before we head to the palace, <pc>.\par
\par
It never hurts to speak to people\emdash and who knows, we might even find out more about this branch.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell There are rumours that the Prince of Gallopolis is an amazing horsemen, but we didn't get a chance to see him last time we were here. I wonder what he looks like...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Hey, <pc>! Why don't you saddle up and try entering a race? You might even win something!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Serena and I have a duty to lead the Luminary\emdash that's you\emdash to Yggdrasil. If we do that, it should answer a lot of questions about what's happening to the world.\par
\par
Now, we're not quite sure how to get there, but getting hold of the Rainbough sounds like it might give us a clue or two...\par
\par
So let's stop wasting time out here and head back to Gallopolis!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Sylvando might be a bit different to most people you meet, but having him with us could be fun. I bet he'd be useful in a fight, too!\par
\par
It certainly doesn't sound as though he'll slow us down\emdash and if he's going to help us capture the Slayer, I don't see what we've got to lose!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Prince Faris really doesn't know what he's doing, does he? He just charged off into the Sands without waiting for us! I mean, enthusiasm's all very well, but honestly...\par
\par
Come on, <pc>. Let's get after him. I dread to think what might happen if he were left to fend for himself against the Slayer!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Did you see that little exchange between Sylvando and Prince Faris, <pc>? The Prince didn't seem very happy at what his life has become...\par
\par
It's almost enough to make you feel sorry for him, but we don't have time for that! The Rainbough should be ours now. Let's head back to the city and get the Sultan to hand it over!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Isn't this just great? Now that we've got Sylvando's ship, we can head out onto the high seas and visit all sorts of new places!\par
\par
I still can't believe he owns his own ship, though... He must be someone pretty important. I wonder what his story is?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I've got a good feeling about this, <pc>! It sounds like the Rainbough that will lead us to Yggdrasil is right here in Gallopolis!\par
\par
Let's go and visit the Prince in his chambers\emdash and mind your manners, you hear? We're dealing with royalty here!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Isn't this exciting, <pc>? We're going to the circus! And for free, as well. This is a real stroke of luck!\par
\par
Now, you remember the plan, right? Prince Faris wants to meet up in the evening in front of the circus tent. Let's not keep him waiting...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell\lquote Then I assume that your need of the Rainbough is not so great after all...\rquote  Grrr! What a little weasel! Just thinking about that useless prince makes my blood boil!\par
\par
Still, you can't get out of this now\emdash you've got to try and win that race! Let's head over to the racetrack and get training!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell That royal get-up really suits you, <pc>! I bet that pathetic prince has never looked half as dashing as you do right now.\par
\par
Anyway, never mind that. It's almost time for the Sand National! You'd better be ready for this, because there's no pulling out now!\par
\par
You're the Luminary, remember! It's practically your duty to win this thing!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Well, well <pc>! You were really impressive out there!\par
\par
It did annoy me that everyone thought you were that stupid prince, though. I mean, he's not fit to lace your boots!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Hmph. Prince Faris asked us to come to his chambers again. Well, there's no point delaying the inevitable. Let's head to the palace and get this over with.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I'm not making any excuses for Prince Faris, but what Serena said is probably true. I suppose we'd better make sure he doesn't get himself maimed or something.\par
\par
In any case, we really can't let this Slayer of the Sands keep rampaging around. It's already hurt at least one innocent person.\par
\par
So come on, <pc>! Let's go and capture the Slayer and finally claim that Rainbough!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Prince Faris and his guards went off into the Celestial Sands to look for the Slayer.\par
\par
Apparently we need to head west and then go north. Let's get after him, <pc>, before he causes any more trouble...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I thought the Sultan was finally going to give us the Rainbough...and then he goes and tells us he sold it to fund that ridiculous horse race! I'm speechless, I really am...\par
\par
Still, Prince Faris did stand up to that monster, and that never would have happened if it weren't for us. That's something at least...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Wow! Not only are we going to find out about the Rainbough, we're going to the circus\emdash with a prince!\par
\par
I think the big top is over in the east of the city. Let's do as His Highness told us and head over there after dark!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell What are you doing, <pc>?\par
\par
If you're looking for Prince Faris, he said he'd be in the stables, over in the west of the city.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Do you think everyone really thought it was Prince Faris on that horse? It'd be quite annoying if no one suspected a thing...\par
\par
Not that any of that matters any more. We've done what the Prince asked us to do. Let's go and claim our reward!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell You don't need to say anything, <pc>. I think we both know what the Prince is planning...\par
\par
I'm not happy about it either, but we've got to get that Rainbough somehow or other. Let's go and see what His Highness has to say for himself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Prince Faris and his guards went off into the Celestial Sands to look for the Slayer.\par
\par
Apparently we need to head west and then go north. Let's get after him, <pc>, before he causes any more trouble...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I'm not sure I quite believe it, but it seems Prince Faris has started taking his knightly training seriously.\par
\par
Of course, he owes it all to us. I just hope he's grateful, that's all...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I had no idea how crazy about racing the Gallopolitans were! The warm-ups for the Sand National must be taking place right now.\par
\par
You know what, <pc>? It might not be a bad idea for you to get some practice in before the big day...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Are you seriously planning on entering a race, <pc>? Well, you'd better win!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Since we're here at the track, you might as well hop on a horse and take part in a race.\par
\par
I mean, you need to take a break sometimes, and who knows\emdash you might even win something.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Serena and I have a duty to lead the Luminary\emdash that's you\emdash to Yggdrasil. If we do that, it should answer a lot of questions about what's happening to the world.\par
\par
Now, we're not quite sure how to get there, but getting hold of the Rainbough sounds like it might give us a clue or two...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell The desert sun was hot enough to scorch my staff, but now that we're somewhere a bit cooler, I sort of miss it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I've only ever been on boring old ferries. I can't wait to have a ship to ourselves!\par
\par
You know, Sylvando must be really rich to have his own ship. We're lucky we bumped into him when we did!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Before we met you, Serena and I would often end up in weird, out-of-the-way places like this.\par
\par
We ARE supposed to be heading for Gondolia, though. Just in case you've forgotten, I mean...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I was sure I'd finally be able to find some nice shoes that fit me, what with Gondolia being one of the busiest ports in the world...\par
\par
But wouldn't you know it, they were all for children! Being younger isn't so bad, but it's making it nigh on impossible to look good!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Whoever put the curse on that poor boy deserves to be beaten to a pulp!\par
\par
Come on, <pc>, let's stop dawdling! We need to find a cave west of Gondolia and siphon off some fresh spring water!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Ahhh, the smell of birdsong nectar! This takes me back!\par
\par
When we were children, Serena and I would always get a little dollop of it mixed with warm water whenever we had a sore throat. It was delicious!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Serena's terribly worried about what's going to happen to Erik, but I just know he'll find a way to get through this.\par
\par
He better had, anyway...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Well, there have been plenty of detours along the way, but we're finally back on the trail of the Rainbough!\par
\par
Dave said that the merchant who'd bought it had headed north-east from Gondolia, towards Zwaardsrust. Let's get after him, <pc>!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell When Benigno first snatched my staff, I thought he was some dirty, low-down street thief...\par
\par
But he was doing it to help his friend, so there's no point in being angry at the poor boy. Now, let's see if we can get Placido talking again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell How many soldiers did the King of Heliodor send here!? The place is crawling with them!\par
\par
If they spot us, we won't stand a chance, so let's stay out of sight.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Before we met you, Serena and I would often end up in weird, out-of-the-way places like this.\par
\par
We ARE supposed to be heading for Gondolia, though. Just in case you've forgotten, I mean...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Ugh! I can't stand dank, mouldy places. Let's find this special water and get out of here!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell <pc>! Have you seriously come in here just to cool down!? Erik's been captured, remember!\par
\par
We need to head back to Gondolia right away! Who knows what they might do to him if we don't get there fast!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Until Serena and I set out in search of you, neither of us had ever seen the sea.\par
\par
Don't get me wrong, I love Arboria and the mountains, but there's just something about being out on the ocean waves\emdash it's like all your worries are washed away.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Serena and I grew up deep in the mountains, you know. Whenever I'd try and practise my magic, someone would shout at me about starting forest fires...\par
\par
Could you imagine growing up out here!? You could just stand on the beach and Frizz to your heart's content! In fact, that's what I feel like doing right now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Hmph! You can tell that this is a resort for the upper crust, can't you!? I mean, just look at these houses!\par
\par
It's so unfair\emdash no one else can enjoy the views. Why do rich people always try and hog everything for themselves?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell So this is a casino, is it? One of my textbooks said that casinos are convivial meeting places for ladies and gentlemen of leisure...\par
\par
What a load of nonsense! It's so noisy in here! And what are all these flashing lights for!? I'd rather be lost in the forest any day!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Listen, I know you want to storm into the castle and sort out this ridiculous misunderstanding, but this really isn't the time.\par
\par
Right now we need to stay calm and get to Yggdrasil. This nonsense with the King will sort itself out, I'm sure of it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Oh, <pc>...\par
\par
